  "details": {
   "description": "Figaro is the oldest olive oil brand in India with a 100-year legacy. We are committed to quality and health, and thus we are constantly evolving to bring you a superior olive oil experience. Every bottle of Figaro comes with an assurance of purity - only the finest quality olives are used, and great care is taken to ensure that the oil retains all its nutritional benefits. Enriched with the goodness of Vitamin E, every drop of our healthy olive oil is pure and primed. Figaro olive oils are also beneficial for reducing cholesterol levels and maintaining the cardio-circulatory system. Matters of the heart are just better with Figaro Olive Oil. But that’s not all!\nFrom maintaining a healthy heart to helping you shed those extra pounds, our oils are cold extracted without any harmful additives like Argemone oil, so you can rest assured that they are the perfect dietary addition for your most precious people. The best part is that it can enrich all your healthy diets with the refreshing taste and fragrance of traditional Olives, from garnishing some Tomato Soup, grinding up some fresh Green Chutney, experimenting with a new Greek Salad, or marinating some tender Chicken Tikka for a house party. So whether you’re planning a perfect meal with the delectable aroma of fresh olives or worried about the risks of diabetes, you know you can trust Figaro Extra Virgin Olive Oil to make it right.",
